flowchart LR
    A[Approved cleanup evidence] --> P[Historical preflight replay]
    B[Action-time cleanup evidence] --> P
    C[Signed remove_and_clean approval] --> P
    D[Retained preflight receipt] --> P
    P --> W{Each action started<br/>before receipt expiry?}
    W -- no --> F[Fail closed]
    W -- yes --> O[Exact post-action evidence bundle]
    E[Typed approved action contract] --> O
    O --> S[Policy-bound zero-finding scan]
    S --> V[Postcondition and lineage verifier]
    V --> R[Canonical cleanup completion report]
    R --> Q[Independent replay after receipt expiry]

    X[No stop / revoke / package / file / Git executor] -. trust boundary .- V
